<title>TURKEY: Turkish 112-day t-bill yield dives to 117.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkish 112-day t-bill yield dives to 117.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 112-day t-bill auction of the Turkish treasury on Tuesday produced the following results.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    :December 25, 1996</p>
<p>	Amount			:133.8 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     :115.64</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     :118.28</p>
<p>	Average yield	     :117.50</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  :234.9 trln</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   :78,648 lira</p>
<p>Pct allocated at lowest price : NA</p>
<p>	Payment date		:September 4, 1996</p>
<p>--Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
